# Architecture

- **Entry**: `app.ts` — CSS, per-monitor windows, `requestHandler` for `ags msg` (`toggle` / `show` / `hide` + window name).
- **Default bar**: React in WebKit (`src/widget/webview/BarWebViewWindow.tsx` + `ui/src/pages/BarStrip.tsx`). GTK bar (`src/widget/bar/`) only when `AURA_GTK_BAR=1`.
- **GTK layer**: `src/widget/` — OSD, launcher host, WebKit shells (`control-center`, `dropdown`, `calendar`, media popup).
- **React layer**: `ui/` — Vite app; build output `ui/dist`. API: `ui/src/lib/api.ts` (POST + `X-Aura-Token`).
- **Sidecar**: `sidecar/` — JSON-RPC, services under `src/services/`. Tests: `sidecar/tests/`.
- **Bridge**: `src/lib/sidecar.ts` spawns the binary; `globalThis.sidecar` is set from `app.ts`.

## Sidecar binary location

1. `AURA_SIDECAR` (absolute path) — `./aura` exports this
2. `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ags/sidecar/target/{release,debug}/ags-sidecar`

A clone outside `~/.config/ags` must set `AURA_SIDECAR` or place the binary on the XDG path.

